    "agent_last_message": "Implemented the full CLI tool at [output/main.js](/workspace/output/main.js) using only the Node.js standard library.\n\nWhat it now does:\n- Accepts exactly `--input <path>` and `--output <path>`\n- Rejects unknown or malformed invocation arguments with exit code `1`\n- Reads and analyzes input as UTF-8 text (malformed UTF-8 => exit code `1`)\n- Computes:\n  - `lines` (per spec newline semantics)\n  - `words` (split by only: space, tab, newline, carriage return, form feed, vertical tab)\n  - `characters` (byte count)\n  - `unique_words` (case-insensitive)\n  - `top_words` (up to 10, sorted by count desc, then lexicographic asc)\n- Writes JSON output in the required schema\n- Uses exit code `0` on success, `2` on unexpected internal errors\n\nValidation I ran:\n- Empty file\n- No trailing newline\n- Trailing newline\n- Multiple consecutive newlines\n- Whitespace-only file\n- Case-insensitive word counting with punctuation preserved\n- Argument errors (`unknown`, missing required values)\n- Missing input file\n- Malformed UTF-8 input\n\nAll behaved as specified.",
